Which is exactly why the PR can help:

1. The PR teaches players that you do not have to stand toe to toe can
melee everything in sight.

2. The PR teaches players that your pet can be a vital ally.

3. The PR gives the potential in lowered AC coupled with being
unburdened to get out of a bad situation.

Now I'm the first to admit that you don't need the PR in order to
utilize these strategies. However running the PR dictates using these
strategies. So it often gives players a different thought process in
terms of playing nethack.

>Another giant hurdle, which is dealing with swarms of monsters jumping
